OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering heavy, perhaps thundery,
OL,7,Fshowers gradually easing off with some
OL,8,Flate evening sunshine possible. Mostly
OL,9,Fdry overnight with a few clear spells,
OL,10,Fbut breezy along coasts. A mild night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FDry to start, perhaps with
OL,13,Fsome early sunny spells. Cloud
OL,14,Fthickening, with rain arriving during
OL,15,Fthe morning, this occasionally heavy
OL,16,Fand perhaps thundery, likely clearing
OL,17,Fduring the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
